<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n18574" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">formātor</span></b> , ōris,
			m.
		id., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a
				former</i>, <i>fashioner</i> (post-Aug.).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">universi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sen. Cons. ad Helv. 8</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Isa. 44, 8</span></i>; <i><span class="en">24</span></i>.
				—<i>Plur.</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">imperii,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Amm. 18, 6</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Trop.</b>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">praeceptor rector est alienorum ingeniorum ac
					formator,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Quint. 10, 2, 20</span></i>
			; so, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">animi (with praeceptor virtutis),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					1 praef.</span></i>
			 § 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">4: morum (with magister),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					Ep. 8, 23, 2</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">agricolae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Pall. 1, 1</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
